                            "not-comparable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c8075dc0-003a-411f-b9ac-d62e930f77b8",
                                "sense_id": "17eff93e-4f71-3e62-8bd9-9b8cb3b595d2",
                                "text": "In fowle reproch of knighthoodes fayre degree, / About his neck an hempen rope he weares, / That with his gliſtring armes does ill agree;"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e2f06514-f583-48bc-a937-d8295745a528",
                                "sense_id": "17eff93e-4f71-3e62-8bd9-9b8cb3b595d2",
                                "text": "A quiet land is this—a land where the slow-moving Basque, with his flat biretta-cap, his red sash and his hempen sandals, tills his scanty farm […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b77ff6bd-eb75-43dc-a95b-5b9dd8f1fd2e",
                                "sense_id": "17eff93e-4f71-3e62-8bd9-9b8cb3b595d2",
                                "text": "Trains from Lime Street to Edge Hill were hauled by an endless hempen rope worked by a stationary engine on the platform at the latter station."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "10487fa0-98e8-4f1e-9e59-0361c855eb8f",
                                "sense_id": "17eff93e-4f71-3e62-8bd9-9b8cb3b595d2",
                                "text": "Apparently, Bridport is noted for \"its hempen manufactures. Its staple productions are twine, fishing nets, and canvas, and much hemp for the purpose is grown.\""
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "34167b17-0d4f-3609-91a1-1f6aaad86bf0",
                        "entry_id": "3c32e09c-1429-38fb-981c-75caff377bf4",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Related to hempen ropes, i.e., to hanging as capital punishment."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "not-comparable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ab313178-a520-4998-a2b9-e859d223b70b",
                                "sense_id": "34167b17-0d4f-3609-91a1-1f6aaad86bf0",
                                "text": "[…] but rid himself also of the companionship of this ruffianly Sir Crispin, to whom no doubt a hempen justice would be meted."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
